Assumptions for the ROI evaluation were based on a 10% conversion rate and an average customer spend of $150 per conversion, totaling an expected $15,000 in revenue. The target audience was assumed to be a 25 to 45-year-old demographic with a higher engagement rate for digital campaigns.

Alternative strategies considered include a dual approach of both online and print advertising to diversify our reach. We've also evaluated a limited geotargeted social media campaign within high-income areas where the expected engagement is higher, and the media cost for summer sales promotions will be lower. Islamist.addAction("Shaping considerations");

